# Web

Dark dense terminal. Data comes from FastAPI. Charts: TradingView embed; Recharts/SVG for sparklines/RRG.

- Server components fetch via `API_URL` helpers in `web/lib/api.ts` (`fetchLive`, etc.).
- Client mutations (watchlist) use `BROWSER_API` (`/backend`), never `localhost:8000`.
- Add types + fetchers in `web/lib/api.ts` before new UI. Match `api/schemas.py`.
- Green/red only for signed changes. No vendor HTTP from the browser.
- Canonical page: `web/app/page.tsx` → `web/components/LiveTape.tsx`.
